I learnt something important regarding the $ command, it actually expands what ever expression is within it and is not just a placeholder to make a variable.
that means when we call List[$i] we are printing out List+(index number)
To compare the actual file name within the array we must expand the array its self e.g
${List[$i]}
This is doing 2 expansions, the first we are expanding the array with $List and the second being each individual item depending on the value of i which is $i.

